argin:0\">PNG to WebP Converter</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert PNG graphics to modern WebP format to reduce web loading times.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open WebP to JPG Converter - Convert next-gen WebP images back into widely compatible JPG files.\" role=\"listitem\" data-category=\"image\" data-title=\"WebP to JPG Converter\" data-desc=\"Convert next-gen WebP images back into widely compatible JPG files.\" href=\"/tools/image/webp-to-jpg-converter\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h2 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">WebP to JPG Converter</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert next-gen WebP images back into widely compatible JPG files.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Image Cropper - Crop images to specific ratios like 16:9, 1:1, 4:3, or custom shapes instantly.\" role=\"listitem\" data-category=\"image\" data-title=\"Image Cropper\" data-desc=\"Crop images to specific ratios like 16:9, 1:1, 4:3, or custom shapes instantly.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-cropper\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h2 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">Image Cropper</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Crop images to specific ratios like 16:9, 1:1, 4:3, or custom shapes instantly.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Image Rotator - Rotate your images 90°, 180°, or 270° clockwise or counter-clockwise.\" role=\"listitem\" data-category=\"image\" data-title=\"Image Rotator\" data-desc=\"Rotate your images 90°, 180°, or 270° clockwise or counter-clockwise.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-rotator\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h2 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">Image Rotator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Rotate your images 90°, 180°, or 270° clockwise or counter-clockwise.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Image Flipper - Mirror images horizontally or vertically to correct mirroring issues.\" role=\"listitem\" data-category=\"image\" data-title=\"Image Flipper\" data-desc=\"Mirror images horizontally or vertically to correct mirroring issues.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-flipper\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h2 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">Image Flipper</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Mirror images horizontally or vertically to correct mirroring issues.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Color Picker &amp; Extractor - Extract colors fr